msgstr ""

#: /home/rsilva/Documents/bipagen/app/templates/index.html:16
msgid ""
"EMU Biological Collections Infrastructure: Acquisition of a Multi-User "
"Platform for Microbiological Collections aimed at Bioprospecting, "
"Pathogens and Genetic Models (BIPAGEN) is a project that proposes the "
"creation of a multi-user platform for the storage, characterization, "
"exchange, and safe use of microbiological collections encompassing "
"microorganisms of interest in bioprospecting, clinical and veterinary "
"pathogens, and genetic models for basic research."
msgstr ""

#: /home/rsilva/Documents/bipagen/app/templates/index.html:19
msgid ""
"The platform integrates high-standard physical infrastructure for "
"microbial preservation, digital collection management systems, and "
"biosafety protocols, serving as a national hub for academic collaboration"
" and technology transfer. Brazil holds one of the largest microbial "
"biodiversities on the planet, still under-explored. Many strains with "
"potential for antibiotics, enzymes, biopolymers, or pharmaceutical and "
"agricultural compounds remain restricted to isolated labs without unified"
" management or structured sharing."
msgstr ""

